{
    "title": "Super Goal: Fun Soccer Game",
    "description": "Draw a line to kick the ball. The directions and routes of the ball are completely controlled by you. Use your wisdom to solve puzzles and score top notch goals!\r\n\r\nIf you want to play a soccer mini-game, this epic 3D soccer game 2024 is your best choice. It is an offline game that can be played without the Internet. It is simple but challenging, you can play anytime anywhere.\r\n\r\nYour soccer mini man can strike the ball with head, feet, and back. In addition, offside and tackle fouls are also allowed in this crazy soccer game. No restrictions, free to kick. Are you ready to battle and become a hero in the matches?\r\n\r\nYou will collect gold coins and keys in every level, which are important items. They will be used to unlock new ball skins and characters. Collect as many as you can, using any crazy methods you can think of!\r\n\r\nThis fun sport game with quick, entertaining gameplay and exquisite graphics will bring you top kicking enjoyment! A perfect game for all ages. As a time-killer, it is undoubtedly the best choice!\r\n\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURES\r\nAI controlled 3D environment. \r\n- In multiplayer matches, players are controlled by highly intelligent game AI.\r\n\r\nVersatile gameplay. \r\n- Not just an eleven-a-side football game. You will face the clashes of players in the leagues, encounter various obstacles in training, and get a lot of gold coins in bonus levels.\r\n\r\nYou do you!\r\n- Superhero, ninja, king, master, cowboy, gentlemen, manager, and many other roles are for you to choose from. \r\n\r\nMakeover\r\n- Dress up yourself as much as you like. Change skins, color and kits to be what you want to be. Create players of your style!\r\n\r\nIconic Stadium Venues\r\n- A variety of scenes available. Romantic beach soccer, crowded city soccer, street soccer, mountain soccer and other styles of stadiums, you will experience one by one.\r\n\r\nNot just football\r\n- In addition to kicking a football, you can also kick basketball, tennis, volleyball, golf, billiards, rugby, and even fun fruit balls, candy balls and animal balls, etc.\r\n\r\nBest goal celebrations\r\n - Celebrate happily. After you score a crazy goal in a match, you can make arrogant moves around your opponents, and they will even join you to make crazy celebration moves! Isn't it fun?\r\n\r\n\r\nSuper Goal is a mini war full of clashes. It\u2019s a survival of the strongest. Try to become a hero in the matches! Control your mini man to clash and score goals! Download it now!\r\n\r\nThis is just the beginning. In order to make a top casual soccer game, we regularly add new things. Stay tuned for updates and tell your friends about the game. More levels and characters are coming!\r\n\r\nWe are looking forward to getting feedback from all of you! Your reviews will be our main reference for improving and perfecting this football game. Join the fun and let us know what you think!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Draw a line to kick the ball. The directions and routes of the ball are completely controlled by you. Use your wisdom to solve puzzles and score top notch goals!<br><br>If you want to play a soccer mini-game, this epic 3D soccer game 2024 is your best choice. It is an offline game that can be played without the Internet. It is simple but challenging, you can play anytime anywhere.<br><br>Your soccer mini man can strike the ball with head, feet, and back. In addition, offside and tackle fouls are also allowed in this crazy soccer game. No restrictions, free to kick. Are you ready to battle and become a hero in the matches?<br><br>You will collect gold coins and keys in every level, which are important items. They will be used to unlock new ball skins and characters. Collect as many as you can, using any crazy methods you can think of!<br><br>This fun sport game with quick, entertaining gameplay and exquisite graphics will bring you top kicking enjoyment! A perfect game for all ages. As a time-killer, it is undoubtedly the best choice!<br><br><br>GAME FEATURES<br>AI controlled 3D environment. <br>- In multiplayer matches, players are controlled by highly intelligent game AI.<br><br>Versatile gameplay. <br>- Not just an eleven-a-side football game. You will face the clashes of players in the leagues, encounter various obstacles in training, and get a lot of gold coins in bonus levels.<br><br>You do you!<br>- Superhero, ninja, king, master, cowboy, gentlemen, manager, and many other roles are for you to choose from. <br><br>Makeover<br>- Dress up yourself as much as you like. Change skins, color and kits to be what you want to be. Create players of your style!<br><br>Iconic Stadium Venues<br>- A variety of scenes available. Romantic beach soccer, crowded city soccer, street soccer, mountain soccer and other styles of stadiums, you will experience one by one.<br><br>Not just football<br>- In addition to kicking a football, you can also kick basketball, tennis, volleyball, golf, billiards, rugby, and even fun fruit balls, candy balls and animal balls, etc.<br><br>Best goal celebrations<br> - Celebrate happily. After you score a crazy goal in a match, you can make arrogant moves around your opponents, and they will even join you to make crazy celebration moves! Isn&#39;t it fun?<br><br><br>Super Goal is a mini war full of clashes. It\u2019s a survival of the strongest. Try to become a hero in the matches! Control your mini man to clash and score goals! Download it now!<br><br>This is just the beginning. In order to make a top casual soccer game, we regularly add new things. Stay tuned for updates and tell your friends about the game. More levels and characters are coming!<br><br>We are looking forward to getting feedback from all of you! Your reviews will be our main reference for improving and perfecting this football game. Join the fun and let us know what you think!",
